<p>Hi there!<br />
So, the biggest problem you have here is the lack of a narrative or a real hook. You gave the barest description of the physical appearance of this entity and&#8230; that's it. I know you might want to keep some info up your sleeve to make a great reveal for those reading the article but this is not the moment to surprise the audience. The goal of this forum is to help you polish your idea and take it to the highest standards possible before going to the main page.<br />
What is this entity's story? Does it have objectives, allegiances, a backstory or an important information to contribute to the Foundation? This is the moment to define and explore these questions, you can write the mysterious bits and alluring questions later.<br />
Also, the Norse accent is not a hook, it is a quirk of the entity. A hook would be a connection to real life events or other events on the SCP universe, a new character or plotline to be explored on other articles and tales, a reference to folklore or mythology, etc.</p>
<p>I hope you figure out how to flesh out this concept and make it a nice article!</p>

